---
import { videos, lightboxJson } from '../../config/videos';
---

<section class="section testimonials-v2">
      <div class="section-gap large">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="v2-section-stack">
            <div class="teatimonial-header">
              <div class="section-badge">
                <div class="section-badge-mark white"></div>
                <p class="font-label white">Testimonials</p>
              </div>
              <h2 class="section-heading-small white-50">Our client words</h2>
            </div>
            <div data-delay="100" data-animation="slide" class="slider-v2 center w-slider" data-autoplay="true" to-top-0="" data-easing="ease" data-hide-arrows="false" data-disable-swipe="false" data-autoplay-limit="1" data-nav-spacing="3" data-duration="500" data-infinite="true">
              <div class="slider-mask-v2 w-slider-mask">
                <div class="slide-v2 center w-slide">
                  <div class="testimonial-v2-card"><img src="/images/Container-14.webp" alt="Modern living room corner with a white sectional sofa featuring two burnt orange cushions and a matching throw, a white ottoman, a small black side table with a brown vase holding dried pampas grass, and sunlight casting soft shadows on glossy marble flooring and beige walls with subtle marble veining and framed artwork." sizes="(max-width: 2040px) 100vw, 2040px" srcset="/images/Container-14-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Container-14-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Container-14-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Container-14-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/Container-14-p-2000.webp 2000w, /images/Container-14.webp 2040w" class="testimonial-image" />
                    <div class="testimonial-v2-scrim"></div>
                    <a href="#" class="testimonial-v2-play w-inline-block w-lightbox">
                      <div class="arrow-small w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="17" viewBox="0 0 14 17" fill="none">
                          <path d="M13 7.634a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.732L1.75 15.86A1 1 0 0 1 .25 15V1.999A1 1 0 0 1 1.75 1.13L13 7.634Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
                        </svg></div>
                      <script type="application/json" class="w-json" set:html={lightboxJson(videos.studio)}></script>
                    </a>
                    <div class="testimonial-v2-body">
                      <p class="card-title body-font white">The city was wearing us down. Atrecxa rgave us light, quiet and a garden, in one house that finally fits the way we live.</p>
                      <div class="testimonial-v2-author"><img src="/images/Image-Design-yours-8.webp" alt="Woman with pale skin and short red hair wearing a beige turtleneck sweater and a brown coat, looking to the side against a plain light gray background." sizes="(max-width: 1107px) 100vw, 1107px" srcset="/images/Image-Design-yours-8-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Image-Design-yours-8-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Image-Design-yours-8-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Image-Design-yours-8.webp 1107w" class="testimonial-v2-avatar" />
                        <div class="text-stack tight">
                          <p class="text-regular white">Annette Black</p>
                          <p class="font-regular job-title">President of Sales</p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="slide-v2 center w-slide">
                  <div class="testimonial-v2-card"><img src="/images/Container-12.webp" alt="Modern living room with curved brown sofa, round glass coffee table with decorative objects, large floor-to-ceiling windows showing desert landscape with mountains, cacti, and trees in warm sunlight." sizes="(max-width: 2400px) 100vw, 2400px" srcset="/images/Container-12-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Container-12-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Container-12-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Container-12-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/Container-12-p-2000.webp 2000w, /images/Container-12.webp 2400w" class="testimonial-image" />
                    <div class="testimonial-v2-scrim"></div>
                    <a href="#" class="testimonial-v2-play w-inline-block w-lightbox">
                      <div class="arrow-small w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="17" viewBox="0 0 14 17" fill="none">
                          <path d="M13 7.634a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.732L1.75 15.86A1 1 0 0 1 .25 15V1.999A1 1 0 0 1 1.75 1.13L13 7.634Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
                        </svg></div>
                      <script type="application/json" class="w-json" set:html={lightboxJson(videos.process)}></script>
                    </a>
                    <div class="testimonial-v2-body">
                      <p class="card-title body-font white">They listened properly before they drew anything. What came back was our own brief, made sharper than we could have put it.</p>
                      <div class="testimonial-v2-author"><img src="/images/Image-42.webp" alt="Young woman with wavy brown hair smiling, wearing a gray shirt, with an outdoor blurred background." class="testimonial-v2-avatar" />
                        <div class="text-stack tight">
                          <p class="text-regular white">Jerome Bell</p>
                          <p class="font-regular white">Medical Assistant</p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="slide-v2 center w-slide">
                  <div class="testimonial-v2-card"><img src="/images/Image-43.webp" alt="Modern living room with beige sofa and two armchairs facing a low marble coffee table, large floor-to-ceiling windows showing a city skyline at dusk, soft lighting from two floor lamps, and neutral decor with a textured rug." sizes="(max-width: 2040px) 100vw, 2040px" srcset="/images/Image-43-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Image-43-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Image-43-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Image-43-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/Image-43-p-2000.webp 2000w, /images/Image-43.webp 2040w" class="testimonial-image" />
                    <div class="testimonial-v2-scrim"></div>
                    <a href="#" class="testimonial-v2-play w-inline-block w-lightbox">
                      <div class="arrow-small w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="17" viewBox="0 0 14 17" fill="none">
                          <path d="M13 7.634a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.732L1.75 15.86A1 1 0 0 1 .25 15V1.999A1 1 0 0 1 1.75 1.13L13 7.634Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
                        </svg></div>
                      <script type="application/json" class="w-json" set:html={lightboxJson(videos.process)}></script>
                    </a>
                    <div class="testimonial-v2-body">
                      <p class="card-title body-font white">Six months in, the house still surprises us. Every room does more than we asked for, and nothing about it feels overworked.</p>
                      <div class="testimonial-v2-author"><img src="/images/Image-Design-yours-18.webp" alt="Young man with curly dark hair, beard, and mustache wearing a black sweatshirt, smiling gently against a softly blurred indoor background with warm lighting." sizes="(max-width: 1144px) 100vw, 1144px" srcset="/images/Image-Design-yours-18-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Image-Design-yours-18-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Image-Design-yours-18-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Image-Design-yours-18.webp 1144w" class="testimonial-v2-avatar" />
                        <div class="text-stack tight">
                          <p class="text-regular white">Cameron Williamson</p>
                          <p class="font-regular white">Web Designer</p>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="testimonial-slider-button center w-slider-arrow-left"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="arrow">
                  <path d="M5.5 12.002H19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                  <path d="M10.9999 18.002C10.9999 18.002 5.00001 13.583 5 12.0019C4.99999 10.4208 11 6.00195 11 6.00195" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                </svg></div>
              <div class="testimonial-slider-button center-right w-slider-arrow-right"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="arrow">
                  <path d="M18.5 11.998L5 11.998" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                  <path d="M13.0001 5.998C13.0001 5.998 19 10.417 19 11.9981C19 13.5792 13 17.998 13 17.998" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
                </svg></div>
              <div class="slider-nav w-slider-nav w-round w-num"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
